ity considerations"},{"type":"h","text":"Dosage forms"},{"type":"h","text":"External Therapies"},{"type":"h","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Indications"},{"type":"h","text":"Contraindications"},{"type":"h","text":"Procedure preparation"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient monitoring"},{"type":"h","text":"Post-procedure care"},{"type":"h","text":"Community Health"},{"type":"h","text":"Participate in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Health camps"},{"type":"h","text":"Community screening"},{"type":"h","text":"Health education"},{"type":"h","text":"Preventive-health programs"},{"type":"h","text":"Lifestyle counselling"}]},{"heading":"Core Clinical Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill Area","Required Capability"],"rows":[[{"text":"Siddha Medicine"},{"text":"Strong theoretical and clinical foundation"}],[{"text":"Clinical Assessment"},{"text":"Patient history and examination"}],[{"text":"Siddha Diagnosis"},{"text":"Understanding traditional diagnostic approaches"}],[{"text":"Pharmacology"},{"text":"Siddha medicines and safety"}],[{"text":"Formulations"},{"text":"Medicine preparation and applications"}],[{"text":"Preventive Care"},{"text":"Lifestyle and health promotion"}],[{"text":"Public Health"},{"text":"Community healthcare"}],[{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Accurate medical records"}],[{"text":"Patient Counselling"},{"text":"Clear health communication"}],[{"text":"Referral"},{"text":"Recognition of cases needing escalation"}],[{"text":"Ethics"},{"text":"Professional healthcare conduct"}],[{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Evidence evaluation"}],[{"text":"Digital Health"},{"text":"Modern healthcare systems"}]]}]},{"heading":"Patient Consultation Workflow","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A structured consultation process is essential."},{"type":"h","text":"Patient Registration"},{"type":"h","text":"Chief Complaint"},{"type":"h","text":"History Taking"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Examination"},{"type":"h","text":"Siddha Assessment"},{"type":"h","text":"Relevant Investigations"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Assessment"},{"type":"h","text":"Treatment Plan"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient Counselling"},{"type":"h","text":"Documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Follow-Up"},{"type":"h","text":"Referral / Escalation When Required"}]},{"heading":"Siddha Clinical Knowledge","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Develop strong understanding of:"},{"type":"h","text":"Siddha Fundamentals"},{"type":"h","text":"Fundamental principles"},{"type":"h","text":"Uyir Thathukkal"},{"type":"h","text":"Udal Thathukkal"},{"type":"h","text":"Mukkutram"},{"type":"h","text":"Siddha diagnostic concepts"},{"type":"h","text":"Preventive principles"},{"type":"h","text":"Siddha Pharmacology"},{"type":"h","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Medicinal plants"},{"type":"h","text":"Minerals"},{"type":"h","text":"Metals and other traditional substances where applicable"},{"type":"h","text":"Formulations"},{"type":"h","text":"Therapeutic applications"},{"type":"h","text":"Preparation methods"},{"type":"h","text":"Safety considerations"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Medicine"},{"type":"h","text":"Develop awareness of:"},{"type":"h","text":"Chronic diseases"},{"type":"h","text":"Lifestyle disorders"},{"type":"h","text":"Digestive conditions"},{"type":"h","text":"Respiratory conditions"},{"type":"h","text":"Skin conditions"},{"type":"h","text":"Musculoskeletal disorders"},{"type":"h","text":"Metabolic conditions"},{"type":"h","text":"Common infections"}]},{"heading":"Modern Biomedical Knowledge","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A good AYUSH Medical Officer should maintain strong biomedical awareness."},{"type":"h","text":"Develop the ability to recognize:"},{"type":"h","text":"Hypertension"},{"type":"h","text":"Diabetes"},{"type":"h","text":"Cardiovascular disease"},{"type":"h","text":"Asthma"},{"type":"h","text":"Severe infections"},{"type":"h","text":"Acute abdominal conditions"},{"type":"h","text":"Neurologica